1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,387
Ghar wale bolte hain kuch kaam kar. Par karun kya?

2
00:00:03,687 --> 00:00:09,026
Chintu, aajkal har gali mein ek cheez bikti hai, momos! Momos ka stall laga!

3
00:00:09,326 --> 00:00:11,671
Par mujhe momos banane nahi aate!

4
00:00:11,971 --> 00:00:18,256
YouTube se seekh, do hafte practice kar. Steamer, thela, fridge, sab 35 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:24,043
Asli jaadu chutney mein hai. Aisi teekhi laal chutney bana, ki log dobara aayein.

6
00:00:24,593 --> 00:00:27,878
Bhaiya, ek plate steam, ek plate fried. Aur chutney extra!

7
00:00:28,178 --> 00:00:31,690
Aath momos ki plate, 70 rupaye. Chutney unlimited!

8
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:37,873
Ek plate ki laagat 25-30 rupaye. Roz 80 plate, yaani dhai-teen hazaar ki bachat.

9
00:00:38,173 --> 00:00:43,620
Tandoori aur kurkure momos bhi rakh. Unka daam zyada, munafa bhi zyada.

10
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:46,766
Chintu Momos, sheher mein famous! Life set!
